<title>USA: Brandywine Realty sets pro rata dividend.</title>
<headline>Brandywine Realty sets pro rata dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTOWN SQUARE, Pa. 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brandywine Realty Trust on Friday declared a fourth quarter dividend of $0.13 per share, payable January 16 to shareholders of record December 30.</p>
<p>The company said the dividend represents a pro rata distribution for the period November 25 through December 31 based on an estimated full quarterly dividend of $0.35 per share, as contemplated in a recently completed secondary public offering of common shares.</p>
</text>
